<doc id="36214" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=36214" title="Luck by Chance">
Luck by Chance

Luck By Chance iku sawijining filem Bollywood sing dirilis taun 2009 lan kanggo pisan disutradarani &lt;a href="Zoya%20Akhtar"&gt;Zoya Akhtar&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki dibintangi déning &lt;a href="Konkona%20Sen%20Sharma"&gt;Konkona Sen Sharma&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Farhan%20Akhtar"&gt;Farhan Akhtar&lt;/a&gt;, karo &lt;a href="Rishi%20Kapoor"&gt;Rishi Kapoor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dimple%20Kapadia"&gt;Dimple Kapadia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Juhi%20Chawla"&gt;Juhi Chawla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hrithik%20Roshan"&gt;Hrithik Roshan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isha%20Sharvani"&gt;Isha Sharvani&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sanjay%20Kapoor"&gt;Sanjay Kapoor&lt;/a&gt;. Ikon filem India &lt;a href="Aamir%20Khan"&gt;Aamir Khan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Shahrukh%20Khan"&gt;Shahrukh Khan&lt;/a&gt; uga nduwé peran kaméo (bintang tamu) ing filem iki.
