<li>Koji (麹) (&lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Bakhar, ranu, marchaar (murcha) (&lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Bubod (&lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Loopang (look pang, ลูกแป้ง) (&lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
