<doc id="37007" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=37007" title="Yudas Iskariot">
Yudas Iskariot

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Yudas Iskariot (tilar donya watara taun &lt;a href="29"&gt;29&lt;/a&gt;–&lt;a href="33"&gt;33&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; יהודה איש־קריות Yəhûḏāh ʾÎš-qəriyyôṯ), putranipun Simon Iskariot (&lt;a href="Injil%20Yohanes"&gt;Yohanes&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D6%2371"&gt;6:71&lt;/a&gt;), panjenenganipun ugi kalebet salah satunggil saking kalih welas rasul ingkang dipunpilih déning &lt;a href="Yesus%20Kristus"&gt;Yesus Kristus&lt;/a&gt;, lan piyambakipun gadhah jejibahan minangka &lt;a href="bendahara"&gt;bendahara&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Injil%20Yohanes"&gt;Yohanes&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D12%236"&gt;12:6&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D13%2329"&gt;13:29&lt;/a&gt;).
Ing kalangan tiyang &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt;, asma Yudas Iskariot sampun boten asing malih. Panjenenganipun dipunanggep minangka pengkhianat amargi sampun masrahaken Yesus Kristus dhumateng imam-imam kepala kanthi regi 30 keping perak (&lt;a href="Injil%20Matius"&gt;Matius&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D26%2314"&gt;26:14-15&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;a href="Alkitab"&gt;Alkitab&lt;/a&gt; ugi nyerat bilih Yudas séda kanthi kaanan padharan suwèk lan sadaya isi padharanipun medal (&lt;a href="Para%20Rasul"&gt;Kisah Para Rasul&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3DKisah%2BPara%2BRasul%26c%3D1%2318"&gt;1:18&lt;/a&gt;). Posisi panjenenganipun dipungentos déning &lt;a href="Matias"&gt;Matias&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun kasewelas murid mbucal undhi kanggé nemtokaken sinten tiyang kaping-12 ingkang badhé nggentosaken (&lt;a href="Para%20Rasul"&gt;Kisah Para Rasul&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3DKisah%2BPara%2BRasul%26c%3D1%2326"&gt;1:26&lt;/a&gt;).

