<doc id="37599" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=37599" title="Alfabèt Kiril">
Alfabèt Kiril

Aksara Kiril (utawa azbuka, saka jeneng lawas aksara-aksara pisanan) iku sajinis &lt;a href="aksara"&gt;aksara&lt;/a&gt; sing dipigunakaké kanggo nulis enem &lt;a href="basa%20Slavia"&gt;basa Slavia&lt;/a&gt; asli (&lt;a href="basa%20B%C3%A9larusia"&gt;Rusputen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Bulgaria"&gt;Bulgariyan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Makedonia"&gt;Makedoniyan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Rusiyan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Serbia"&gt;Serbiyan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="basa%20Ukraina"&gt;Ukrayinan&lt;/a&gt;) lan akèh basa-basa liyané sing dipigunakaké ing &lt;a href="Uni%20Soviet"&gt;Uni Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asia"&gt;Asiya&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Éropa Wétan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Étimologi</h2>
Étimologi.
Aksara Kiril dijenengaké asal saka jeneng &lt;a href="Santo%20Sirillus"&gt;Santo Kirillus&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: ΑΓΙΟΣ ΚΥΡΙΛΛΟΣ, "Agios Kurillos"). &lt;a href="Santo%20Sirillus"&gt;Santo Kirillus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Santo%20Methodius"&gt;Santo Methodius&lt;/a&gt; (saduluré), yaiku para misiyonaris saka &lt;a href="Konstantinopel"&gt;Konstantinopel&lt;/a&gt; sing miturut carita nyiptakaké aksara Kiril nalika nyebaraké agama &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Bangsa%20Slavia"&gt;Bangsa Slawiya&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Basa Ruslan</h2>
Basa Ruslan.
Tabel iki nuduhaké aksara Kiril sing dipigunakaké ing &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;basa Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;.
