<doc id="37733" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=37733" title="Milo">
Milo

Milo (; gaya MILO) ya iku produk bubuk &lt;a href="Malt"&gt;malted&lt;/a&gt; rasa coklat sing diprodhuksi déning &lt;a href="Nestl%C3%A9"&gt;Nestlé&lt;/a&gt;, biasane dicampur karo &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, banyu panas, utawa loro-lorone, kanggo gawé &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n"&gt;ombènan&lt;/a&gt;. Iki pisanan dikembangake ing Australia dening Thomas Mayne ing taun 1934.
Paling umum didol minangka bubuk ing kaleng ijo, asring nggambarake macem-macem kegiatan olahraga, Milo kasedhiya minangka ombenan campuran ing sawetara negara lan banjur dikembangake dadi bar cemilan, &lt;a href="sereal%20sarapan"&gt;sereal sarapan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="granola"&gt;granola&lt;/a&gt; protein. Komposisi lan rasa beda-beda ing saben negara.Milo njaga popularitas sing signifikan ing macem-macem negara ing saindenging jagad, utamane ing Australasia, Asia, lan Afrika
Kajaba saka Australia, Milo misuwur ing pirang-pirang negara kalebu &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brun%C3%A9i%20Darussalam"&gt;Brunei&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="C%C3%A8ylon"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malad%C3%A9wa"&gt;Maladewa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thai"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cil%C3%A9"&gt;Chili&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kolombia"&gt;Kolombia&lt;/a&gt;, lan negara-negara ing &lt;a href="Afrika%20Bag%C3%A9yan%20Kidul"&gt;sisih kidul&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Afrika%20Bag%C3%A9yan%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afrika%20Tengah"&gt;Afrika Tengah, Afrika&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Afrika%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Wétan, Afrika&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kulon"&gt;Kulon&lt;/a&gt;. 
